# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, on every platform.
# Without this, Git for Windows (the CI runner windows-latest included) checks files out with CRLF, and a test that
# reads a committed file byte by byte (the live demo page must have no carriage return) fails there.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
